model golden_g9
  tally 2
  on 2026-10-17
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31
  note "T, M1 (issue #108), DONE gate 2: G9, a question with a payment is refused (goldens.md: unchanged; C-19, L §5.18: an ask's grammar has no pay). The base answers; the part g9_pay.tally asks what konto would hold with a payment written into the ask."

source prototype "the prototype's question rule C-19 (engine/spec/verification/goldens.md)"

unit PLN: currency minor 0.01

place konto: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..

place world: outside lives 2026-01-01..

ask g9_konto: bal(konto, 2026-12-31)

version g9_household
  cite prototype
  governs always
  known 2026-10-17
  opening[konto] = 1000 at 2026-01-01 start "an invented opening balance"
